{
  "dom_id": "step-e7882",
  "name": "Example: Estimating a Population Mean From the Sample Mean",
  "problem": "Suppose the following data is sampled from a population. Compute an estimate for the population mean.\n\n$$\n6, \\quad 13, \\quad 7, \\quad 5, \\quad 14 , \\quad 11, \\quad 7\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "Suppose $X_1, X_2, \\ldots, X_n$ is a sequence of random variables representing a random sample of size $n$ drawn from a population with the population mean $\\mu.$ \nThen, the sample mean $\\overline{X}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\overline{X} \n= \\dfrac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n X_i.\n$$\n\nNote that:\n\n- $\\overline{X}$ is the mean value of $X_1,X_2,\\ldots, X_n,$ while $\\bar{x}$ is the mean of a specific sample $x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_n,$\n\n- the sample mean $\\overline{X}$ is an estimator of the population mean $\\mu,$ and\n\n- the value $\\hat{\\mu} = \\bar{x}$ is an estimate of the population mean $\\mu.$\n\nTherefore, our estimate for the population mean is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{^}{\\mu } & =\\overset{―}{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{7}{x}_{i} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}(6+13+7+5+14+11+7) \\\\  & =\\frac{63}{7} \\\\  & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e7882\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Estimating a Population Mean From the Sample Mean</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e7882\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n               